      "body": "When a host without `toolInfo` replays a nonempty result after reload, `viewStateRef` starts as `{}` and this call writes that default through the retained capability. Because the nonempty branch never restores first, previously saved pagination, sorting, and disclosure state is erased. Restore capability-backed state first, or defer capability-only persistence until the user changes the state.",
